    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36976" root="كسر" body-key="k">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كُسُورٌ</span></b>  (assumed tropical:) The <i>turnings, bendings,</i> or <i>windings,</i>
(<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَعَاطِف</span>, K, TA,) <i>and parts eaten away by
torrents,</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جِرَفَة</span>, TA,) <i>and ravines,</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شِعَاب</span>, K,
TA,) of valleys, (K, TA,) and of mountains:
(TA:) a pl. without a sing.: (K:) you do not
say <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَسْرُ الوَادِى</span> nor <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كِسْرُ الوادى</span>. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرْضٌ ذَاتُ كُسُورٍ</span> (tropical:)  <i>A land having</i> [<i>places of</i>]
<i>ascent and descent.</i> (S, A.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَسْرٌ</span>
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كِسْرٌ</span>.

